{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "満開っ!🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "6期生の長嶋凛桜(ながしまりお)です!"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日も読みに来てくれてありがとう"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回は最近の楽しかったこと報告"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "- ̗̀ ﾃﾞﾃﾞｰﾝ　 ̖́-"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202510/mobqXkMOc.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ディズニーランドに行ってきました!!"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "実に小学2年生ぶり!"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "しかも、、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202510/mob2taFsA.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ここねんと!"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "電車で向かっている時から\n２人で\n｢お城見えないかなぁ〜｣\n｢何から乗るぅ〜?｣って始終ノリノリでした🐭"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "パークに入ってからも大はしゃぎ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ずっと２人で目をキラキラさせて\nあれも乗ろう!これも乗ろう!って"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "1番笑ったのはコーヒーカップ!!"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "序盤に私がグルングルン回し過ぎて\n最後は２人ともカップの中で笑いながら倒れていました👻"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "笑いすぎて顔が筋肉痛だよ\n誘ってくれてありがとうねᡣ𐭩"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202510/mobBhTuLW.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "可愛いここねんᡣ𐭩\n本当に楽しすぎたよ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また行こうね!"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202510/mob4D8Y85.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "#りおたんのクローゼット"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この日はさくらんぼコーデ🍒´-"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ピンクで夢カワ気分ですᡣ𐭩"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "カバンは姉からのお下がりで大切に使ってるんだぁ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そうそう!\nトップスもね、セットアップで可愛いんだよ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ほらっ！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ってあれ、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202510/mobgEviev.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "よく見えないねﾌﾟｰ😗"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "地元にいた頃は"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ディズニーに行く＝大旅行"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "のイメージだったので凄く新鮮な気持ち!"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ハロウィンシーズンだから仮装をしている方も沢山いらっしゃって"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私もいつか仮装して遊びたいな〜って新たな夢がまた1つ出来ました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "⋆͛📢⋆お知らせ⋆͛📢⋆"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "11月1日から6期生の｢乃木坂46 Mail｣｢乃木坂46 メッセージ｣が始まります!"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回みたい